WEBVTT

00:05:59.522 --> 00:06:01.899
the McLaren Shadow esports team,

00:06:02.733 --> 00:06:04.110
That's their car.

00:06:05.319 --> 00:06:08.697
These two cars are almost
indistinguishable from each other.

00:06:08.739 --> 00:06:11.033
They're mirroring each other
in the physical

00:06:11.075 --> 00:06:12.910
and the digital world of sports.

00:06:13.619 --> 00:06:14.954
I spent time with Lando,

00:06:14.954 --> 00:06:17.748
one of those drivers,
talking about gaming.

00:06:18.416 --> 00:06:19.875
Lando is saying that the game,

00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:22.586
not the state-of-the-art simulators
that the McLaren have,

00:06:22.628 --> 00:06:23.838
the game,

00:06:23.879 --> 00:06:28.217
is so realistic that he can tell
if a bump in the road is out of place.

00:06:28.259 --> 00:06:31.470
The only thing that he feels
is missing is the wind.